1
00:01:35,960 --> 00:01:40,150
[River of No Return]

2
00:01:40,170 --> 00:01:43,000
[Episode 17: Dear Brother]

3
00:02:13,510 --> 00:02:14,230
Stop there!

4
00:02:28,750 --> 00:02:29,980
Run!

5
00:02:29,520 --> 00:02:32,890
♪ Together, let us laugh
at the fickleness of the world ♪

6
00:02:32,910 --> 00:02:36,410
♪ Together, let us sing
until the light of dawn ♪

7
00:02:36,620 --> 00:02:39,780
♪ With you by my side, this life
has not been lived in vain ♪

8
00:02:39,800 --> 00:02:43,200
♪ Looking back at us,
all the way we have come ♪

9
00:02:43,329 --> 00:02:46,540
♪ What is most unforgettable? ♪

10
00:02:56,120 --> 00:02:59,240
♪ When the world mocks absurd wishes ♪

11
00:02:59,260 --> 00:03:02,770
♪ You chose to join me in my folly ♪

12
00:03:03,130 --> 00:03:05,880
♪ When people can only share weal ♪

13
00:03:05,910 --> 00:03:09,800
♪ You only wish to share my woe ♪

14
00:03:10,070 --> 00:03:13,190
♪ A heart full of burning passion,
a passion that burns in the heart ♪

15
00:03:11,760 --> 00:03:12,910
Old Mule!

16
00:03:13,210 --> 00:03:16,329
♪ Battered and bruised all along the way ♪

17
00:03:16,350 --> 00:03:19,300
♪ Things I cannot repay you
for in this lifetime ♪

18
00:03:19,329 --> 00:03:22,610
♪ I will keep it etched in my heart ♪

19
00:03:25,100 --> 00:03:27,430
Was that you who fired
the cannon just now?

20
00:03:28,800 --> 00:03:30,500
I have a personal matter
to take care of first.

21
00:03:30,500 --> 00:03:31,250
See you

22
00:03:31,700 --> 00:03:32,700
at the dock later.

23
00:03:32,980 --> 00:03:33,850
Old Mule.

24
00:03:34,050 --> 00:03:35,850
Don't stir up any extra trouble.

25
00:03:35,870 --> 00:03:37,270
Okay. You be careful too.

26
00:03:38,579 --> 00:03:39,260
How about

27
00:03:39,290 --> 00:03:40,390
I come with you?

28
00:03:41,070 --> 00:03:41,510
No.

29
00:03:41,760 --> 00:03:44,090
This is something I have to handle myself.

30
00:03:48,329 --> 00:03:49,140
See you at the dock.

31
00:03:49,140 --> 00:03:49,950
See you there!

32
00:04:03,130 --> 00:04:05,010
By order of
the Ministry of Justice Branch:

33
00:04:05,010 --> 00:04:07,340
this place is harboring wanted criminals

34
00:04:07,420 --> 00:04:08,820
and concealing weapons.

35
00:04:08,890 --> 00:04:10,620
It is to be raided immediately.

36
00:04:12,400 --> 00:04:14,330
Officers, there must be some mistake.

37
00:04:14,330 --> 00:04:15,830
We're just blacksmiths.

38
00:04:19,570 --> 00:04:20,810
Anyone who resists

39
00:04:21,779 --> 00:04:24,310
will be punished
to the full extent of the law.

40
00:04:42,880 --> 00:04:43,940
Who are you people?

41
00:04:45,050 --> 00:04:47,010
What gives you the right to arrest us?

42
00:04:47,010 --> 00:04:49,050
Enough talk. Take them away.

43
00:04:49,670 --> 00:04:51,510
Move! Move! Hurry up.

44
00:04:51,630 --> 00:04:53,260
Hurry up. Move! Move it.

45
00:04:53,290 --> 00:04:54,090
-Move!
-Move!

46
00:04:54,100 --> 00:04:54,740
-Hurry up!
-Hurry up!

47
00:04:54,740 --> 00:04:55,540
Don't dawdle.

48
00:04:56,200 --> 00:04:57,640
Hurry up! Keep moving.

49
00:04:57,670 --> 00:05:00,540
[Zuihong Brothel]

50
00:05:03,430 --> 00:05:05,010
I'm coming.

51
00:05:08,890 --> 00:05:10,740
My patience is running thin.

52
00:05:12,470 --> 00:05:14,870
You're pushing your luck, you little minx.

53
00:05:15,080 --> 00:05:15,710
Come catch me!

54
00:05:15,710 --> 00:05:17,170
Get over here, you!

55
00:05:23,450 --> 00:05:24,570
Get out here, Xue!

56
00:05:27,810 --> 00:05:28,930
Come out!

57
00:05:32,320 --> 00:05:33,130
Liuzi!

58
00:05:33,600 --> 00:05:34,380
Xizi!

59
00:05:34,430 --> 00:05:35,490
Grab your weapons!

60
00:05:36,280 --> 00:05:37,490
Boss, what's going on?

61
00:05:37,490 --> 00:05:38,340
Why are you still sitting around?

62
00:05:38,340 --> 00:05:39,450
Liuzi, get up! Come on!

63
00:05:39,450 --> 00:05:39,970
Alright, alright.

64
00:05:39,970 --> 00:05:40,760
I'll go check right away.

65
00:05:40,760 --> 00:05:41,400
What's going on?

66
00:05:41,400 --> 00:05:42,050
Hurry up!

67
00:05:42,460 --> 00:05:44,130
Xizi, what are you dawdling for?

68
00:05:44,130 --> 00:05:44,630
Hurry up!

69
00:05:44,630 --> 00:05:45,510
What's going on, boss?

70
00:05:45,510 --> 00:05:45,930
Hurry!

71
00:05:45,950 --> 00:05:47,550
Why are there so many people?

72
00:05:48,140 --> 00:05:49,740
I'll go check. I'll go check.

73
00:05:53,480 --> 00:05:54,480
Get out here, Xue!

74
00:05:57,480 --> 00:05:58,680
Come out! Come out!

75
00:05:59,170 --> 00:06:00,170
Come out quickly!

76
00:06:02,080 --> 00:06:03,010
Not here either.

77
00:06:16,720 --> 00:06:18,260
Looks like there's a fighting going on.

78
00:06:18,260 --> 00:06:19,920
I don't know. What's going on?

79
00:06:43,500 --> 00:06:44,170
Move.

80
00:06:54,300 --> 00:06:54,840
Bro.

81
00:06:54,860 --> 00:06:55,510
Bro.

82
00:06:59,460 --> 00:07:00,200
Bro,

83
00:07:00,490 --> 00:07:01,780
please have mercy.

84
00:07:02,390 --> 00:07:03,320
What do you want?

85
00:07:03,450 --> 00:07:05,250
I can give you whatever you want.

86
00:07:05,810 --> 00:07:07,040
It's you again!

87
00:07:07,910 --> 00:07:09,560
What exactly do you want?

88
00:07:09,610 --> 00:07:11,910
Where's Kong Shiba's identification token?

89
00:07:11,910 --> 00:07:13,260
What token?

90
00:07:13,330 --> 00:07:14,740
Can't remember, huh?

91
00:07:16,200 --> 00:07:17,970
If you can't remember,
then don't bother trying.

92
00:07:17,970 --> 00:07:19,300
I'm trying! I'm trying!

93
00:07:20,630 --> 00:07:22,230
It's here! It's here!

94
00:07:28,610 --> 00:07:30,540
I'm an official of the Ming Empire.

95
00:07:30,880 --> 00:07:33,180
Do you realize how serious a crime it is

96
00:07:34,000 --> 00:07:35,860
to murder a government official?

97
00:07:35,870 --> 00:07:37,200
You're not even related

98
00:07:37,640 --> 00:07:38,950
to Kong Shiba.

99
00:07:38,970 --> 00:07:41,770
Is his worthless life
really worth risking yours?

100
00:07:48,020 --> 00:07:48,900
Look up.

101
00:07:49,370 --> 00:07:50,140
Look up!

102
00:07:51,540 --> 00:07:54,060
He was a scout who guarded
our nation's borders.

103
00:07:54,060 --> 00:07:56,930
He should have died in battle
in the northern desert region,

104
00:07:56,930 --> 00:07:58,030
not been poisoned to death in prison

105
00:07:58,030 --> 00:07:59,800
by a corrupt official like you!

106
00:08:00,470 --> 00:08:02,530
And you dare call his life worthless?

107
00:08:03,380 --> 00:08:05,040
You think I'm afraid of him...

108
00:08:20,670 --> 00:08:21,370
Guys!

109
00:08:21,670 --> 00:08:22,730
We're pulling out!

110
00:08:23,260 --> 00:08:23,820
Let's go!

111
00:08:31,140 --> 00:08:32,669
Save me...

112
00:08:36,460 --> 00:08:37,980
Save me...

113
00:08:58,300 --> 00:09:00,170
[Huai'an Ministry of Justice Branch]

114
00:09:00,860 --> 00:09:01,480
My Lord.

115
00:09:17,870 --> 00:09:21,200
This is the register of all prisoners
currently in custody.

116
00:09:29,980 --> 00:09:31,040
Where's Hong Wang?

117
00:09:34,790 --> 00:09:36,170
Where's Hong Wang!

118
00:09:38,620 --> 00:09:40,020
I deserve to die, My Lord.

119
00:09:40,020 --> 00:09:41,860
That Hong Wang is too cunning.

120
00:09:41,930 --> 00:09:43,320
He switched bodies

121
00:09:44,710 --> 00:09:46,110
and escaped in the chaos.

122
00:10:00,360 --> 00:10:01,090
I'm done for.

123
00:10:04,890 --> 00:10:06,270
Where's the Crown Prince?

124
00:10:06,270 --> 00:10:08,320
He said he had some personal matters
to attend to.

125
00:10:08,320 --> 00:10:10,250
We agreed to meet at the dock later.

126
00:10:25,970 --> 00:10:26,780
Yulu!

127
00:10:27,390 --> 00:10:28,100
Yulu!

128
00:10:28,890 --> 00:10:29,770
Yulu!

129
00:10:30,390 --> 00:10:31,190
Yulu!

130
00:10:31,460 --> 00:10:32,360
Yulu!

131
00:10:42,860 --> 00:10:43,730
He's dead.

132
00:10:46,240 --> 00:10:46,920
Not inside.

133
00:10:50,620 --> 00:10:51,840
My sister's missing.

134
00:10:53,030 --> 00:10:55,160
Looks like they've all been captured.

135
00:10:56,560 --> 00:10:57,890
Who could've done this?

136
00:10:59,550 --> 00:11:00,810
I want revenge.

137
00:11:02,690 --> 00:11:04,190
Move! Don't try anything!

138
00:11:04,210 --> 00:11:05,190
What are you looking at?

139
00:11:05,190 --> 00:11:06,890
Get in quickly! Did you hear me?

140
00:11:06,890 --> 00:11:07,840
Hurry up! Move!

141
00:11:07,890 --> 00:11:08,570
Let go!

142
00:11:08,700 --> 00:11:10,300
I'm talking to you. Hurry up.

143
00:11:10,360 --> 00:11:11,270
Don't touch me!

144
00:11:11,390 --> 00:11:12,150
Get in!

145
00:11:12,190 --> 00:11:13,030
Hurry up. Get in!

146
00:11:13,030 --> 00:11:14,150
Get in! Move!

147
00:11:14,270 --> 00:11:15,450
-Get in!
-Get in!

148
00:11:15,640 --> 00:11:16,270
Hurry!

149
00:11:17,010 --> 00:11:18,370
First, you're not wearing
an official uniform.

150
00:11:18,370 --> 00:11:20,520
Second, you don't have
an imperial warrant.

151
00:11:20,520 --> 00:11:22,650
On what grounds should I listen to you?

152
00:11:23,160 --> 00:11:24,410
The Iron Alliance followers

153
00:11:24,410 --> 00:11:25,920
used illegally manufactured firearms

154
00:11:25,920 --> 00:11:28,590
to cause such a commotion in Huai'an,

155
00:11:28,960 --> 00:11:31,120
yet your Ministry of Justice Branch
has dragged its feet

156
00:11:31,120 --> 00:11:32,350
and shirked its responsibilities.

157
00:11:32,350 --> 00:11:33,880
Are you truly incompetent,

158
00:11:35,280 --> 00:11:36,850
or do you have some ulterior motive?

159
00:11:36,850 --> 00:11:38,810
What do you take
our Ministry of Justice Branch for?

160
00:11:38,810 --> 00:11:41,540
We're merely a subordinate yamen
carrying out orders.

161
00:11:41,540 --> 00:11:43,400
First, a grain ship
had its mooring lines cut,

162
00:11:43,400 --> 00:11:45,470
then the trackers rioted.

163
00:11:46,090 --> 00:11:46,990
Our Ministry of Justice Branch

164
00:11:46,990 --> 00:11:50,060
was the first to respond
and investigate both incidents.

165
00:11:50,060 --> 00:11:53,090
And as for this so-called
Iron Alliance rebellion,

166
00:11:53,420 --> 00:11:55,460
even if we had superhuman powers,
we couldn't possibly handle that.

167
00:11:55,460 --> 00:11:56,790
Then let me ask you this.

168
00:11:57,160 --> 00:11:58,730
Isn't the circulation of gunpowder
and saltpeter

169
00:11:58,730 --> 00:12:00,680
regulated by the imperial court?

170
00:12:01,560 --> 00:12:03,280
Shouldn't there be a traceable source
for the materials

171
00:12:03,280 --> 00:12:04,890
used by the Iron Alliance
to manufacture firearms illegally?

172
00:12:04,890 --> 00:12:06,080
And isn't investigating smuggling

173
00:12:06,080 --> 00:12:08,610
and corruption
precisely your Branch's responsibility?

174
00:12:08,610 --> 00:12:09,970
Let me remind you:

175
00:12:10,130 --> 00:12:11,230
these firearms

176
00:12:11,390 --> 00:12:12,090
were found

177
00:12:12,110 --> 00:12:14,090
right here in Huai'an.

178
00:12:14,640 --> 00:12:16,680
If the imperial court
holds you accountable,

179
00:12:16,680 --> 00:12:18,970
your office will be charged with
dereliction of duty.

180
00:12:18,970 --> 00:12:20,920
And none of you will be able to

181
00:12:21,350 --> 00:12:22,630
escape the consequences!

182
00:12:22,630 --> 00:12:23,760
What exactly are you getting at?

183
00:12:23,760 --> 00:12:25,060
Alright, that's enough.

184
00:12:25,060 --> 00:12:25,840
Zhan Peng.

185
00:12:27,150 --> 00:12:28,730
With the Iron Alliance rebellion

186
00:12:28,730 --> 00:12:30,130
causing widespread panic,

187
00:12:30,130 --> 00:12:32,700
and the case of Commander Wang's poisoning
still unsolved,

188
00:12:32,700 --> 00:12:34,890
the Huai'an prefectural office
has done nothing.

189
00:12:34,890 --> 00:12:37,560
Why make things difficult for
this mere seventh-rank official?

190
00:12:37,560 --> 00:12:38,490
Prince of Linzi.

191
00:12:40,040 --> 00:12:41,640
You're wise, Your Highness.

192
00:12:42,400 --> 00:12:44,440
I've come here to make one thing clear:

193
00:12:44,440 --> 00:12:46,080
all officials of
the Ministry of Justice Branch

194
00:12:46,080 --> 00:12:47,500
just need to follow orders
and carry out their duties.

195
00:12:47,500 --> 00:12:48,100
Zhan Peng.

196
00:12:48,160 --> 00:12:48,940
Yes, Your Highness.

197
00:12:48,940 --> 00:12:50,210
Dispatch the Yong'an Battalion at once.

198
00:12:50,210 --> 00:12:51,820
Have them seal off all waterways
and land routes—

199
00:12:51,820 --> 00:12:52,940
allow entry only, no exit—

200
00:12:52,940 --> 00:12:55,280
and spare no effort in hunting down
the remnants of the Iron Alliance.

201
00:12:55,280 --> 00:12:57,010
Then summon the Yong'an Battalion's
commanding officer

202
00:12:57,010 --> 00:12:58,660
to the Ministry of Justice Branch

203
00:12:58,660 --> 00:13:01,260
to discuss the suppression
of this rebellion.

204
00:13:01,760 --> 00:13:03,360
Understood, Your Highness.

205
00:13:07,440 --> 00:13:10,640
Also, I'll leave it to your
Ministry of Justice Branch

206
00:13:10,740 --> 00:13:13,140
to post wanted notices throughout the city

207
00:13:13,170 --> 00:13:15,420
and spare no effort
in capturing the remaining rebels.

208
00:13:15,420 --> 00:13:16,220
Yes, Your Highness.

209
00:13:16,220 --> 00:13:18,180
It is my duty.

210
00:13:24,010 --> 00:13:25,250
Do your job well

211
00:13:25,590 --> 00:13:27,260
and make sure I remember you.

212
00:13:28,440 --> 00:13:29,520
Once this is over,

213
00:13:29,560 --> 00:13:33,020
you'll come with me to the capital
and make a name for yourself.

214
00:13:42,370 --> 00:13:45,140
Any word on the people
you were supposed to help us receive?

215
00:13:45,140 --> 00:13:46,330
Everything's taken care of.

216
00:13:46,330 --> 00:13:47,330
This way, please.

217
00:13:56,020 --> 00:13:56,990
Dr. Su?

218
00:13:57,090 --> 00:13:58,420
What are you doing here?

219
00:13:58,920 --> 00:13:59,750
I'd just arrived in Huai'an

220
00:13:59,750 --> 00:14:02,080
when I heard about
the incident at the dam.

221
00:14:02,610 --> 00:14:04,780
I ran into Dr. Su in Huai'an.

222
00:14:05,090 --> 00:14:06,590
Thanks to her help,

223
00:14:06,610 --> 00:14:08,070
we were able to rescue you.

224
00:14:08,920 --> 00:14:09,660
My sister

225
00:14:10,160 --> 00:14:13,160
and the members of the Iron Alliance
have been arrested.

226
00:14:13,160 --> 00:14:13,940
Look at this.

227
00:14:15,590 --> 00:14:18,250
Wanted notices are plastered
all over the city.

228
00:14:21,520 --> 00:14:25,280
[Chief of Bandits, Hong Wang]

229
00:14:25,340 --> 00:14:32,300
[Fang Du, Commissioner of
Huai'an's Ministry of Justice Branch]

230
00:14:34,440 --> 00:14:35,300
That's right.

231
00:14:36,220 --> 00:14:37,500
They're after me.

232
00:14:38,210 --> 00:14:40,040
Who do you think is behind this?

233
00:14:42,730 --> 00:14:44,460
It's been only a few hours since

234
00:14:44,630 --> 00:14:46,440
the Ministry of Justice was bombed.

235
00:14:46,440 --> 00:14:48,130
It would take at least 2 or 3 days

236
00:14:48,130 --> 00:14:49,860
to apprehend a major fugitive.

237
00:14:50,330 --> 00:14:52,520
Now the entire city of Huai'an
is under lockdown,

238
00:14:52,520 --> 00:14:55,450
with the Yong'an Battalion
stationed at every turn.

239
00:14:56,130 --> 00:14:57,860
Who has that kind of authority?

240
00:14:59,680 --> 00:15:02,440
The Canal Transport Office
is currently leaderless, yet someone

241
00:15:02,440 --> 00:15:05,500
managed to put such a massive operation
in motion in just half a day.

242
00:15:05,500 --> 00:15:06,710
Unless he...

243
00:15:07,250 --> 00:15:08,870
Unless the one giving orders

244
00:15:09,250 --> 00:15:11,750
outranks the local judicial
and military authorities,

245
00:15:11,750 --> 00:15:13,010
and no one in Huai'an

246
00:15:13,560 --> 00:15:15,140
dares to question

247
00:15:15,210 --> 00:15:16,540
his orders.

248
00:15:16,940 --> 00:15:18,940
They can only rush to carry them out.

249
00:15:19,720 --> 00:15:22,570
It's that Suanni, right?

250
00:15:25,400 --> 00:15:27,060
We need to rescue your sister.

251
00:15:28,410 --> 00:15:29,360
And that Suanni—

252
00:15:30,820 --> 00:15:32,420
we need to confront him, too.

253
00:15:35,800 --> 00:15:36,940
When you guys are putting these up,

254
00:15:36,940 --> 00:15:38,090
don't just focus on the main roads.

255
00:15:38,090 --> 00:15:40,470
Pay attention to the side streets
and alleys as well.

256
00:15:40,470 --> 00:15:41,060
Oh, right,

257
00:15:41,060 --> 00:15:43,060
don't go soft on anyone
who looks suspicious.

258
00:15:43,060 --> 00:15:43,970
Take them in first.

259
00:15:43,970 --> 00:15:44,830
-Okay.
-Got it.

260
00:15:46,890 --> 00:15:47,540
Fang Du.

261
00:15:49,370 --> 00:15:50,060
Fang Du!

262
00:15:53,280 --> 00:15:53,850
Tingyi.

263
00:15:54,060 --> 00:15:55,390
How dare you show your face here again?

264
00:15:55,390 --> 00:15:56,320
What's going on?

265
00:15:57,090 --> 00:15:58,260
The Yong'an Battalion

266
00:15:58,260 --> 00:15:59,850
has blocked the docks,
sealed the city gates,

267
00:15:59,850 --> 00:16:01,800
and set up checkpoints everywhere.

268
00:16:01,800 --> 00:16:02,730
What exactly are

269
00:16:02,940 --> 00:16:04,140
these soldiers up to?

270
00:16:07,420 --> 00:16:08,420
What else?

271
00:16:10,040 --> 00:16:12,510
Don't tell me you really don't know
your friend

272
00:16:12,510 --> 00:16:13,970
is with the Iron Alliance.

273
00:16:15,850 --> 00:16:16,780
Who issued this?

274
00:16:20,300 --> 00:16:21,900
Was it your chief commander?

275
00:16:22,680 --> 00:16:23,970
Yu Tingyi.

276
00:16:24,480 --> 00:16:27,250
What exactly have you been doing
all these years?

277
00:16:28,800 --> 00:16:30,130
Doing my job, of course.

278
00:16:31,160 --> 00:16:33,780
Do you realize this is treason?

279
00:16:33,900 --> 00:16:35,390
It's a capital offense!

280
00:16:36,850 --> 00:16:37,470
Fang Du.

281
00:16:37,750 --> 00:16:40,160
We'll soon find out who's really
committing treason.

282
00:16:40,160 --> 00:16:41,680
Right now, I just want to know

283
00:16:41,680 --> 00:16:42,610
who issued this.

284
00:16:42,970 --> 00:16:43,900
Who issued this?

285
00:16:46,850 --> 00:16:47,730
Tingyi.

286
00:16:48,750 --> 00:16:50,870
I've thought this over again and again.

287
00:16:50,870 --> 00:16:52,900
Something about this whole affair
doesn't add up.

288
00:16:52,900 --> 00:16:56,100
I don't want to know too much about
what's really going on.

289
00:16:56,520 --> 00:16:57,680
Now, for your own good,

290
00:16:57,680 --> 00:16:58,810
don't ask questions

291
00:16:59,040 --> 00:17:00,370
and leave immediately.

292
00:17:01,160 --> 00:17:02,090
I'm not leaving.

293
00:17:03,060 --> 00:17:03,780
Go.

294
00:17:04,349 --> 00:17:04,940
Go!

295
00:17:05,200 --> 00:17:06,400
Don't push me. I'm not leaving.

296
00:17:06,400 --> 00:17:07,000
-Go!
-I want to see you...

297
00:17:07,000 --> 00:17:08,000
Lord Yu Qian.

298
00:17:17,160 --> 00:17:17,940
Wait, I...

299
00:17:18,680 --> 00:17:19,440
Get in!

300
00:17:26,200 --> 00:17:27,060
Your Highness.

301
00:17:27,420 --> 00:17:28,830
It's a misunderstanding.

302
00:17:28,830 --> 00:17:29,660
Lord Fang.

303
00:17:29,960 --> 00:17:32,370
Have you caught the men
who escaped from Zuihong Brothel?

304
00:17:32,370 --> 00:17:34,430
After Your Highness left yesterday,

305
00:17:34,500 --> 00:17:37,070
we sent more men to search the city,

306
00:17:37,390 --> 00:17:39,030
but found nothing.

307
00:17:39,630 --> 00:17:40,890
As for that Xue Baguan,

308
00:17:40,890 --> 00:17:42,020
he often mistreated

309
00:17:42,180 --> 00:17:43,810
the trackers at the dam.

310
00:17:43,850 --> 00:17:44,680
His murder was likely

311
00:17:44,680 --> 00:17:46,440
an act of revenge by the trackers

312
00:17:46,440 --> 00:17:48,000
who escaped from prison yesterday,

313
00:17:48,000 --> 00:17:50,000
settling an old score.

314
00:17:50,700 --> 00:17:53,300
As for that Hong Wang
Your Highness mentioned,

315
00:17:53,400 --> 00:17:55,590
he'd be too busy evading capture

316
00:17:55,850 --> 00:17:56,700
to go

317
00:17:57,700 --> 00:17:59,560
looking for trouble, I'm afraid.

318
00:18:03,570 --> 00:18:04,730
Hong Wang

319
00:18:05,070 --> 00:18:06,770
is actually Zhu Zhanji.

320
00:18:07,700 --> 00:18:09,640
You really don't know him.

321
00:18:10,530 --> 00:18:12,400
He's as cunning as they come,

322
00:18:12,590 --> 00:18:15,400
ruthless in his methods,
and never lets an insult go unavenged.

323
00:18:15,400 --> 00:18:17,800
This has his handiwork
written all over it.

324
00:18:18,400 --> 00:18:19,050
Right.

325
00:18:19,110 --> 00:18:19,740
Right.

326
00:18:19,770 --> 00:18:21,270
It's just I never expected

327
00:18:22,000 --> 00:18:24,570
you to know Yu Qian.

328
00:18:26,960 --> 00:18:30,160
I was wondering
how a whole Ministry of Justice Branch

329
00:18:30,240 --> 00:18:32,200
could fail to contain a cornered

330
00:18:32,220 --> 00:18:33,520
Crown Prince,

331
00:18:34,480 --> 00:18:36,520
and even those lowly trackers in prison

332
00:18:36,520 --> 00:18:37,760
were rescued.

333
00:18:38,160 --> 00:18:41,090
Now I see there's been a traitor
working from within.

334
00:18:43,470 --> 00:18:44,310
Lord Fang,

335
00:18:44,810 --> 00:18:48,290
do you find it amusing to team up
with this Yu Qian

336
00:18:48,720 --> 00:18:49,720
to toy with me?

337
00:18:50,890 --> 00:18:51,270
I...

338
00:18:53,480 --> 00:18:54,380
Please hear me out, Your Highness.

339
00:18:54,380 --> 00:18:55,980
I absolutely had no such intention!

340
00:18:55,980 --> 00:18:56,910
Prince of Linzi.

341
00:18:57,480 --> 00:18:58,900
So you're the mastermind
behind the bombing

342
00:18:58,900 --> 00:19:00,960
of the Crown Prince's treasure ship.

343
00:19:04,570 --> 00:19:06,610
You bombed the ship
to assassinate the heir apparent,

344
00:19:06,610 --> 00:19:08,400
destabilizing the very foundation
of the state.

345
00:19:08,400 --> 00:19:10,860
And now,
disregarding the laws of the court,

346
00:19:11,130 --> 00:19:14,570
you've secretly usurped the power of
Huai'an prefectural office,

347
00:19:14,570 --> 00:19:15,970
twisting truth into falsehood,

348
00:19:15,970 --> 00:19:18,170
and framing the innocent as criminals.

349
00:19:18,570 --> 00:19:20,700
You really think you're above the law!

350
00:19:22,570 --> 00:19:23,610
In Huai'an,

351
00:19:23,830 --> 00:19:24,940
I am the law.

352
00:19:25,320 --> 00:19:26,430
I am the heavens.

353
00:19:27,920 --> 00:19:29,490
Judicial Commissioner Fang Du

354
00:19:29,490 --> 00:19:30,850
abused his position for personal gain,

355
00:19:30,850 --> 00:19:33,290
colluded with the traitor Yu Qian
to plot rebellion,

356
00:19:33,290 --> 00:19:35,290
incited the trackers to riot,

357
00:19:35,310 --> 00:19:37,440
helped criminals break out of prison,

358
00:19:37,890 --> 00:19:40,290
and then even attempted to assassinate me.

359
00:19:44,320 --> 00:19:45,520
Let him go! Let him go!

360
00:19:45,660 --> 00:19:46,840
Your Highness! Your Highness!

361
00:19:46,840 --> 00:19:47,840
Please see the truth, Your Highness!

362
00:19:47,840 --> 00:19:48,960
-Fang Du!
-Your Highness!

363
00:19:48,960 --> 00:19:50,030
Your Highness!

364
00:19:50,640 --> 00:19:51,970
Tell me, who should die?

365
00:19:52,310 --> 00:19:53,310
You or him?

366
00:19:54,640 --> 00:19:56,240
The Ming Code clearly states

367
00:19:56,720 --> 00:19:59,050
that treason and plotting rebellion

368
00:19:59,240 --> 00:20:01,480
are among the unforgivable crimes.

369
00:20:03,160 --> 00:20:04,470
You and your father

370
00:20:05,960 --> 00:20:08,890
are on the brink of death,
yet still refuse to repent.

371
00:20:11,030 --> 00:20:12,140
Prince of Linzi!

372
00:20:13,400 --> 00:20:15,740
You've brought disaster upon
our nation and the people!

373
00:20:15,740 --> 00:20:16,550
Keep still!

374
00:20:18,440 --> 00:20:20,460
I'm an imperial official!

375
00:20:20,940 --> 00:20:22,920
You're committing
arbitrary acts of violence!

376
00:20:22,920 --> 00:20:24,450
You have no right to do this!

377
00:20:25,940 --> 00:20:26,940
Prince of Linzi!

378
00:20:38,850 --> 00:20:41,290
I do admire people like you
who aren't afraid of death.

379
00:20:41,290 --> 00:20:43,370
What virtues does Zhu Zhanji possess

380
00:20:43,370 --> 00:20:45,680
that make you so fiercely loyal to him?

381
00:20:47,830 --> 00:20:49,570
Now it's your turn to try

382
00:20:49,790 --> 00:20:52,330
the feeling of impending death.

383
00:20:58,500 --> 00:20:59,350
Let him go.

384
00:21:03,720 --> 00:21:04,590
Suanni.

385
00:21:04,880 --> 00:21:07,180
-Don't move!
-Stay put!

386
00:21:21,350 --> 00:21:21,970
Take him down.

387
00:21:21,970 --> 00:21:23,740
I'd like to see who dares!

388
00:21:29,240 --> 00:21:30,100
Prince of Linzi

389
00:21:30,830 --> 00:21:33,130
is the mastermind behind the bombing
of the Crown Prince's treasure ship.

390
00:21:33,130 --> 00:21:34,660
Anyone who obeys his orders

391
00:21:34,680 --> 00:21:36,010
is committing treason!

392
00:22:02,720 --> 00:22:03,340
Step one.

393
00:22:03,660 --> 00:22:04,930
[Strategy 1: Luring the Tiger Away
from the Mountain]

394
00:22:03,770 --> 00:22:05,480
Luring the tiger away from the mountain.

395
00:22:05,480 --> 00:22:07,220
Light a thick smoke signal
from the high ground

396
00:22:07,220 --> 00:22:08,290
at the southeastern watchtower.

397
00:22:08,290 --> 00:22:11,290
The Yong'an Battalion will only see smoke
rising in the northwest.

398
00:22:11,290 --> 00:22:13,570
As long as the direction is right
and it resembles a border alert,

399
00:22:11,420 --> 00:22:13,460
[Yong'an Battalion]

400
00:22:13,790 --> 00:22:17,370
they won't have time to check
exactly where the smoke is coming from.

401
00:22:17,370 --> 00:22:17,830
My Lord.

402
00:22:18,000 --> 00:22:19,530
Red signal flares have gone up in Huai'an,

403
00:22:19,530 --> 00:22:21,220
but the beacon tower in the northwest
is also sending out a smoke alert.

404
00:22:21,220 --> 00:22:22,420
The Ministry of Justice Branch
in the city has issued

405
00:22:22,420 --> 00:22:23,640
Prince of Linzi's direct orders.

406
00:22:23,640 --> 00:22:25,110
-What should we...
-You fool!

407
00:22:25,110 --> 00:22:25,700
Idiot!

408
00:22:25,960 --> 00:22:28,020
Can't you tell which takes priority?

409
00:22:28,180 --> 00:22:29,720
The Ministry of Justice Branch

410
00:22:29,720 --> 00:22:31,960
is only good for arresting
a few Iron Alliance bandits.

411
00:22:31,960 --> 00:22:33,830
Our military orders are clear:
mobilize at the sight of smoke.

412
00:22:33,830 --> 00:22:37,090
How many heads do you think
you have to spare if you disobey?

413
00:22:37,140 --> 00:22:37,670
This way!

414
00:22:37,740 --> 00:22:38,310
Yes!

415
00:22:43,240 --> 00:22:44,440
My dear brother.

416
00:22:44,570 --> 00:22:45,890
It's been so long,

417
00:22:46,070 --> 00:22:47,590
yet you didn't even call me
"Your Majesty."

418
00:22:47,590 --> 00:22:48,140
What,

419
00:22:48,420 --> 00:22:49,750
don't you recognize me?

420
00:22:50,660 --> 00:22:51,460
Zhu Zhanji.

421
00:22:51,850 --> 00:22:52,830
Long time no see.

422
00:22:53,460 --> 00:22:55,350
You've really run out of allies,
haven't you?

423
00:22:55,350 --> 00:22:56,050
You don't actually think

424
00:22:56,050 --> 00:22:57,440
you can beat me with a few hundred

425
00:22:57,440 --> 00:22:58,770
peasants today, do you?

426
00:22:58,850 --> 00:22:59,810
My dear brother.

427
00:23:00,370 --> 00:23:01,770
You don't actually think

428
00:23:02,030 --> 00:23:03,960
the Huai'an prefectural garrison

429
00:23:04,140 --> 00:23:06,270
will still obey your commands, do you?

430
00:23:06,400 --> 00:23:07,000
Step two.

431
00:23:07,220 --> 00:23:08,090
The delaying tactic.

432
00:23:07,300 --> 00:23:09,480
[Strategy 2: The Delaying Tactic]

433
00:23:08,310 --> 00:23:10,240
How long do we need to hold them off?

434
00:23:11,830 --> 00:23:12,770
At least an hour.

435
00:23:13,110 --> 00:23:14,240
Can you manage that?

436
00:23:14,550 --> 00:23:15,850
The trackers along both banks
of the Huai'an River

437
00:23:15,850 --> 00:23:16,900
can gather at the sound of

438
00:23:16,900 --> 00:23:17,760
the work chant.

439
00:23:17,890 --> 00:23:18,240
And if

440
00:23:18,550 --> 00:23:20,370
our wives and parents rally
the people around them,

441
00:23:20,370 --> 00:23:21,770
we can bring in even more.

442
00:23:22,000 --> 00:23:23,000
But don't forget,

443
00:23:23,400 --> 00:23:24,400
they are soldiers

444
00:23:24,550 --> 00:23:25,700
and we are civilians.

445
00:23:25,700 --> 00:23:27,100
We mustn't come to blows.

446
00:23:27,130 --> 00:23:28,730
There must be no casualties.

447
00:23:39,830 --> 00:23:41,490
Why are you blocking the road?

448
00:23:44,140 --> 00:23:46,480
My Lord, there's been
a sudden outbreak of plague here.

449
00:23:46,480 --> 00:23:47,410
What did you say?

450
00:23:47,970 --> 00:23:49,030
There's been an outbreak of plague.

451
00:23:49,030 --> 00:23:49,740
To prevent it from spreading,

452
00:23:49,740 --> 00:23:51,530
we've had to set up an emergency clinic
right here in the street.

453
00:23:51,530 --> 00:23:52,710
[Huai'an Prefectural Garrison]

454
00:23:51,890 --> 00:23:54,020
How long before you can clear the road?

455
00:23:57,480 --> 00:23:57,960
My Lord.

456
00:23:57,960 --> 00:23:59,220
Don't come any closer!

457
00:24:01,370 --> 00:24:02,790
Not to mention finishing
treating everyone,

458
00:24:02,790 --> 00:24:04,990
even if we send everyone away right now,

459
00:24:05,390 --> 00:24:07,250
it'll still take at least an hour.

460
00:24:14,590 --> 00:24:15,650
Take another road!

461
00:24:16,090 --> 00:24:17,430
You two, be quick!

462
00:24:17,770 --> 00:24:18,890
Right, put the oil there!

463
00:24:18,890 --> 00:24:19,850
Get more straw.

464
00:24:20,250 --> 00:24:21,240
-Make the fire bigger.
-Got it.

465
00:24:21,240 --> 00:24:22,400
We need plenty of smoke in a moment.

466
00:24:22,400 --> 00:24:23,130
Got that?

467
00:24:23,920 --> 00:24:25,520
Get the smoke and fire going!

468
00:24:28,000 --> 00:24:28,570
Hurry up!

469
00:24:31,370 --> 00:24:31,920
Stop!

470
00:24:32,960 --> 00:24:33,840
What's going on ahead?

471
00:24:33,840 --> 00:24:35,970
Sir, there's a fire up ahead.

472
00:24:36,440 --> 00:24:38,090
Several houses have burned down,

473
00:24:38,090 --> 00:24:39,640
and the collapsed buildings
are blocking the road.

474
00:24:39,640 --> 00:24:41,640
They're rescuing people right now.

475
00:24:42,530 --> 00:24:44,400
We had to take a detour through 3 blocks,

476
00:24:44,400 --> 00:24:46,000
and now we've run into a fire.

477
00:24:48,030 --> 00:24:48,570
Let's go!

478
00:25:01,440 --> 00:25:02,840
What are you waiting for?

479
00:25:03,160 --> 00:25:05,090
The Huai'an prefectural garrison

480
00:25:05,200 --> 00:25:06,720
or the Yong'an Battalion?

481
00:25:08,290 --> 00:25:10,630
So you were the one
who set off the smoke signal.

482
00:25:10,630 --> 00:25:11,530
So what?

483
00:25:12,330 --> 00:25:16,090
At the Yong'an Battalion's marching pace,
they must've already turned back by now.

484
00:25:16,090 --> 00:25:19,150
You're only buying yourself a little time,
that's all.

485
00:25:22,900 --> 00:25:24,480
Suanni, oh Suanni.

486
00:25:25,370 --> 00:25:29,100
I'm afraid the reinforcements
you're counting on won't be coming.

487
00:25:29,920 --> 00:25:31,290
If you don't believe me,

488
00:25:32,090 --> 00:25:34,810
then I will gladly wait here with you.

489
00:25:46,240 --> 00:25:48,440
What a tragic death!

490
00:25:46,390 --> 00:25:47,730
♪ Swaying along, swaying along ♪

491
00:25:47,750 --> 00:25:49,050
♪ Swaying along, swaying along ♪

492
00:25:49,070 --> 00:25:50,570
♪ Swaying along—
what's all the swaying for? ♪

493
00:25:49,810 --> 00:25:50,480
Move aside!

494
00:25:51,160 --> 00:25:51,850
Move aside!

495
00:25:51,820 --> 00:25:53,070
♪ Chasing them down, chasing them down ♪

496
00:25:53,200 --> 00:25:54,440
♪ Chasing them down, chasing them down ♪

497
00:25:54,460 --> 00:25:56,690
♪ Chasing them down—
what am I chasing for? ♪

498
00:25:54,640 --> 00:25:56,130
Why is the corpse left
in the middle of the road?

499
00:25:56,130 --> 00:25:57,160
It's blocking the way!

500
00:25:57,160 --> 00:25:57,980
Who is the family of the deceased?

501
00:25:57,280 --> 00:25:58,870
♪ Who knows? Who cares about me? ♪

502
00:25:58,740 --> 00:26:01,050
My Lord, My Lord, My Lord.

503
00:25:58,900 --> 00:26:00,300
♪ Who knows? Who cares about me? ♪

504
00:26:00,410 --> 00:26:02,110
♪ Who knows where home is? ♪

505
00:26:01,290 --> 00:26:03,130
You came just in time, My Lord!

506
00:26:02,940 --> 00:26:04,380
♪ To hell with princes and nobles ♪

507
00:26:03,330 --> 00:26:04,240
My Lord!

508
00:26:04,330 --> 00:26:06,810
You must seek justice for us, My Lord!

509
00:26:04,420 --> 00:26:05,810
♪ To hell with
what the history books say ♪

510
00:26:05,830 --> 00:26:07,750
♪ I'm my own guardian angel ♪

511
00:26:07,740 --> 00:26:08,630
What's going on?

512
00:26:08,630 --> 00:26:09,890
Help us!

513
00:26:09,930 --> 00:26:13,000
My brother was beaten to death
for no reason.

514
00:26:14,240 --> 00:26:16,330
They dumped his body here,
and no one has done a thing about it!

515
00:26:16,330 --> 00:26:18,400
My Lord, I reported it to the authorities,
but it was no use.

516
00:26:18,400 --> 00:26:18,850
Someone!

517
00:26:18,850 --> 00:26:21,050
My Lord, you must seek justice for us!

518
00:26:21,050 --> 00:26:21,850
My Lord!

519
00:26:23,000 --> 00:26:23,730
Turn around!

520
00:26:23,810 --> 00:26:24,340
Let's go!

521
00:26:28,160 --> 00:26:29,000
Suanni

522
00:26:30,130 --> 00:26:32,130
also has a troop of private cavalry.

523
00:26:32,140 --> 00:26:33,160
Cavalry...

524
00:26:36,030 --> 00:26:37,560
I'll figure something out.

525
00:27:06,240 --> 00:27:08,130
So you knew all along

526
00:27:08,130 --> 00:27:09,930
that I'd be waiting for you here.

527
00:27:10,330 --> 00:27:11,050
Of course.

528
00:27:11,700 --> 00:27:14,030
You've never beaten me since we were kids.

529
00:27:14,330 --> 00:27:15,790
This time is no exception.

530
00:27:16,530 --> 00:27:19,190
That's only because my father
told me not to win.

531
00:27:21,050 --> 00:27:22,510
Your father only said that

532
00:27:22,610 --> 00:27:24,530
to save you some face.

533
00:27:25,350 --> 00:27:26,810
And you actually believed

534
00:27:27,660 --> 00:27:29,590
he was the reason you couldn't win?

535
00:27:31,370 --> 00:27:33,500
Your Father knows better than anyone,

536
00:27:34,090 --> 00:27:35,680
Whether then or now,

537
00:27:36,740 --> 00:27:38,440
when it comes to commanding people
and wielding influence,

538
00:27:38,440 --> 00:27:39,200
tell me,

539
00:27:40,200 --> 00:27:41,530
have you ever beaten me?

540
00:27:42,460 --> 00:27:43,860
You're asking for death.

541
00:28:23,310 --> 00:28:24,370
You've lost again,

542
00:28:24,480 --> 00:28:25,610
my dear brother.

543
00:28:31,610 --> 00:28:34,680
You went to such lengths to set this trap,
hoping I'd walk right into it.

544
00:28:34,680 --> 00:28:36,940
So where are your men and your troops now?

545
00:28:36,940 --> 00:28:39,940
Where are all those
underhanded schemes of yours now?

546
00:28:40,920 --> 00:28:43,250
You can't even beat me once
in a fair fight.

547
00:28:43,290 --> 00:28:44,090
Suanni.

548
00:28:45,080 --> 00:28:48,810
Tell me, how can you possibly hope
to compete with me for the throne?

549
00:28:50,850 --> 00:28:52,530
You came to Huai'an alone,

550
00:28:52,970 --> 00:28:53,960
without troops or authority.

551
00:28:53,960 --> 00:28:55,820
How on earth did you pull this off?

552
00:28:57,420 --> 00:28:59,680
If you still can't figure that out by now,

553
00:28:59,680 --> 00:29:02,340
then you clearly have a lot more
growing up to do.

554
00:29:06,400 --> 00:29:08,000
Do you think you really won?

555
00:29:08,350 --> 00:29:09,840
Even if I lost,

556
00:29:10,180 --> 00:29:11,050
your men

557
00:29:11,610 --> 00:29:12,920
won't survive either.

558
00:29:13,890 --> 00:29:14,690
Rectifier Yu.

559
00:29:15,000 --> 00:29:16,130
Yes, Your Highness.

560
00:29:16,310 --> 00:29:17,090
Tie him up.

561
00:29:19,680 --> 00:29:20,940
-Get on your knees!
-Get on your knees!

562
00:29:20,940 --> 00:29:21,940
Get on your knees!

563
00:29:22,300 --> 00:29:24,360
[Strategy 3: A Two-Pronged Approach]

564
00:29:22,530 --> 00:29:24,590
Step three, a two-pronged approach.

565
00:29:24,640 --> 00:29:26,550
I need 20 men who aren't afraid to
fight to the death—

566
00:29:26,550 --> 00:29:27,830
not to throw their lives away,

567
00:29:27,830 --> 00:29:29,490
but to storm that gate with me.

568
00:29:29,550 --> 00:29:31,350
Men with military experience
would be ideal,

569
00:29:31,350 --> 00:29:32,330
as long as they can fight.

570
00:29:32,330 --> 00:29:33,290
The other team

571
00:29:33,480 --> 00:29:35,070
will follow Wu Dingyuan to the prison
to break out the captives.

572
00:29:35,070 --> 00:29:35,920
Boss, I'm willing.

573
00:29:35,920 --> 00:29:36,790
Boss, I'm willing too.

574
00:29:36,790 --> 00:29:37,310
I'm willing too.

575
00:29:37,310 --> 00:29:37,980
We'll all go together.

576
00:29:37,980 --> 00:29:38,510
Alright.

577
00:29:38,980 --> 00:29:40,050
Thank you, guys.

578
00:29:40,550 --> 00:29:41,410
Remember this.

579
00:29:41,740 --> 00:29:43,070
If the operation fails,

580
00:29:43,180 --> 00:29:45,140
we'll have to make a getaway as planned.

581
00:29:45,140 --> 00:29:46,440
I'm afraid you'll have to

582
00:29:46,440 --> 00:29:47,900
go into hiding for a while.

583
00:29:48,030 --> 00:29:49,090
Boss, don't worry.

584
00:29:49,160 --> 00:29:50,550
From Qingjiang Lock to Li Dam,

585
00:29:50,550 --> 00:29:51,330
across all 9 locks and 12 dams,

586
00:29:51,330 --> 00:29:52,740
every one of our canal buddies,

587
00:29:52,740 --> 00:29:54,940
all 3,700 towropes' worth,
will follow your commands.

588
00:29:54,940 --> 00:29:55,670
We trust you.

589
00:29:56,590 --> 00:29:57,130
Alright!

590
00:30:01,610 --> 00:30:02,540
What do you want?

591
00:30:03,000 --> 00:30:03,890
What do you want?

592
00:30:03,890 --> 00:30:05,390
Don't come any closer. You...

593
00:30:05,390 --> 00:30:06,320
What do you want?

594
00:30:06,370 --> 00:30:07,230
Don't touch me!

595
00:30:09,530 --> 00:30:10,960
Lord Zhan! Lord Zhan!

596
00:30:11,900 --> 00:30:12,700
What's wrong?

597
00:30:13,030 --> 00:30:13,630
Lord Zhan!

598
00:30:13,770 --> 00:30:14,430
This is bad.

599
00:30:14,700 --> 00:30:16,960
Something bad happened to Young Master!

600
00:30:17,090 --> 00:30:18,320
You guys keep a close eye on her.

601
00:30:18,320 --> 00:30:19,140
The rest of you, come with me!

602
00:30:19,140 --> 00:30:19,640
Yes!

603
00:30:21,770 --> 00:30:22,370
Lord Zhan!

604
00:30:34,180 --> 00:30:35,330
Dingyuan, I'm here!

605
00:30:35,700 --> 00:30:37,500
Where do you think you're going?

606
00:30:38,590 --> 00:30:41,390
That was you at Wang Ji's residence too,
wasn't it?

607
00:30:42,240 --> 00:30:42,840
Dingyuan!

608
00:30:43,980 --> 00:30:44,610
Yulu.

609
00:30:45,370 --> 00:30:46,440
She's your sister?

610
00:30:46,870 --> 00:30:49,470
If I'd known it, I would've killed her
just now.

611
00:30:52,400 --> 00:30:54,220
What exactly did Zhu Zhanji promise you

612
00:30:54,220 --> 00:30:56,080
that you'd risk your life for him?

613
00:30:56,200 --> 00:30:57,180
Then let me ask you,

614
00:30:57,180 --> 00:30:59,380
what did your Young Master promise you?

615
00:31:00,460 --> 00:31:01,640
As long as my master

616
00:31:03,240 --> 00:31:04,440
inherits the throne,

617
00:31:04,810 --> 00:31:05,920
I will

618
00:31:06,440 --> 00:31:08,050
be set for a bright future.

619
00:31:09,610 --> 00:31:11,540
Isn't that what you're hoping for, too?

620
00:31:11,540 --> 00:31:12,470
Wake up.

621
00:31:12,850 --> 00:31:14,480
Not a single soldier
from the Yong'an Battalion

622
00:31:14,480 --> 00:31:15,530
is coming.

623
00:31:16,000 --> 00:31:16,860
For all we know,

624
00:31:17,220 --> 00:31:19,620
he might not even make it out alive
himself.

625
00:31:20,850 --> 00:31:21,650
Open the door!

626
00:31:27,310 --> 00:31:27,910
Dingyuan!

627
00:31:28,870 --> 00:31:29,570
Dingyuan!

628
00:31:35,480 --> 00:31:36,130
Yulu!

629
00:31:36,480 --> 00:31:37,080
Dingyuan!

630
00:31:55,720 --> 00:31:57,290
Dingyuan, fire!

631
00:31:58,570 --> 00:31:59,170
Dingyuan!

632
00:31:59,550 --> 00:32:01,610
Forget about me! Just get out of here!

633
00:32:03,290 --> 00:32:03,890
Dingyuan!

634
00:32:05,370 --> 00:32:06,770
I'm telling you to leave!

635
00:32:06,940 --> 00:32:08,000
Do you hear me?

636
00:32:08,330 --> 00:32:09,390
Hurry up and leave!

637
00:32:14,500 --> 00:32:15,530
Just go!

638
00:32:16,290 --> 00:32:17,090
Go!

639
00:32:17,440 --> 00:32:19,480
Go! Do you hear me?

640
00:32:20,290 --> 00:32:21,240
Yulu!

641
00:32:21,630 --> 00:32:23,240
I'm telling you to get lost!

642
00:32:46,370 --> 00:32:48,400
Mr. Liang should have finished
dealing with those people.

643
00:32:48,400 --> 00:32:49,600
Why isn't he here yet?

644
00:32:51,050 --> 00:32:52,310
Can he handle it alone?

645
00:32:54,050 --> 00:32:55,910
Could something have gone wrong?

646
00:32:56,890 --> 00:32:57,440
Oh no.

647
00:32:57,690 --> 00:32:59,750
He must have gone to find Wu Dingyuan.

648
00:33:08,850 --> 00:33:09,640
Dingyuan...

649
00:33:11,660 --> 00:33:12,850
They said

650
00:33:13,890 --> 00:33:15,610
Aunt Hong is in Jinan.

651
00:33:17,030 --> 00:33:19,240
Can you take me to Jinan?

652
00:33:24,350 --> 00:33:25,240
I was wrong.

653
00:33:28,960 --> 00:33:29,680
I was wrong

654
00:33:29,920 --> 00:33:31,320
from the very beginning.

655
00:33:34,130 --> 00:33:35,730
Back when we were in Jinling,

656
00:33:36,770 --> 00:33:37,900
I was already wrong.

657
00:33:38,530 --> 00:33:40,160
I'll never leave you again.

658
00:33:41,090 --> 00:33:41,960
Never again.

659
00:33:43,440 --> 00:33:44,200
Let's go.

660
00:33:45,140 --> 00:33:45,920
Let's go.

661
00:33:49,440 --> 00:33:50,330
Guys.

662
00:33:51,140 --> 00:33:52,240
Is everyone alright?

663
00:33:52,240 --> 00:33:53,500
-We're fine.
-We're fine.

664
00:33:53,500 --> 00:33:54,500
Thank you so much.

665
00:33:54,980 --> 00:33:55,780
Young Master.

666
00:33:56,350 --> 00:33:57,150
Young Master!

667
00:33:58,330 --> 00:33:59,480
Suanni and the others

668
00:33:59,480 --> 00:34:00,940
have been escorted there.

669
00:34:01,310 --> 00:34:01,890
This

670
00:34:02,720 --> 00:34:05,650
is the official boat pass
Fang Du left for me earlier.

671
00:34:07,700 --> 00:34:08,290
Okay.

672
00:34:12,770 --> 00:34:13,440
Dr. Su?

673
00:34:13,560 --> 00:34:14,250
Lord Yu.

674
00:34:16,350 --> 00:34:17,610
Good-for-Nothing...

675
00:34:43,350 --> 00:34:43,889
Dr. Su.

676
00:34:43,960 --> 00:34:44,760
Go take a look.

677
00:34:47,460 --> 00:34:48,460
Come on, her hand.

678
00:34:52,520 --> 00:34:54,320
Where do you think you're going?

679
00:34:57,810 --> 00:34:59,250
-What do you want?
-What do you want?

680
00:34:59,250 --> 00:34:59,690
Young Master!

681
00:34:59,690 --> 00:35:00,620
What do you want?

682
00:35:05,350 --> 00:35:06,080
Guys.

683
00:35:06,920 --> 00:35:07,920
Step back for now.

684
00:35:18,230 --> 00:35:21,290
It's time for you to keep your promise,
don't you think?

685
00:35:24,750 --> 00:35:25,370
Mr. Liang.

686
00:35:31,560 --> 00:35:32,370
Sick Madman.

687
00:35:33,210 --> 00:35:34,470
You're still not dead?

688
00:35:39,370 --> 00:35:40,170
Young Master!

689
00:35:47,360 --> 00:35:48,040
I'll leave!

690
00:35:54,810 --> 00:35:57,270
Good-for-Nothing,
are you out of your mind?

691
00:36:08,890 --> 00:36:09,600
Old Mule.

692
00:36:10,730 --> 00:36:12,790
Take care on the rest of your journey.

693
00:36:15,210 --> 00:36:16,340
Good-for-Nothing!

694
00:36:17,230 --> 00:36:18,080
Get over here!

695
00:36:19,080 --> 00:36:19,880
Get over here!

696
00:36:26,190 --> 00:36:26,720
Let's go!

697
00:36:28,850 --> 00:36:29,650
Young Master!

698
00:36:30,890 --> 00:36:31,690
Young Master!

699
00:36:47,150 --> 00:36:50,030
[Beijing Imperial City]

700
00:39:00,940 --> 00:39:01,770
Your Majesty.

701
00:39:01,960 --> 00:39:04,100
Marquis Zhang has been waiting outside
for quite some time.

702
00:39:04,100 --> 00:39:05,080
Show him in.

703
00:39:05,440 --> 00:39:06,000
Yes.

704
00:39:10,690 --> 00:39:11,250
Sister.

705
00:39:12,120 --> 00:39:13,210
His Majesty has passed away,

706
00:39:13,210 --> 00:39:14,170
and my nephew's fate remains unknown...

707
00:39:14,170 --> 00:39:15,250
My son is not dead!

708
00:39:18,230 --> 00:39:18,960
But, Sister,

709
00:39:19,270 --> 00:39:20,500
the Crown Prince's treasure ship
was bombed...

710
00:39:20,500 --> 00:39:21,440
I said,

711
00:39:22,890 --> 00:39:23,920
my son is not dead.

712
00:39:27,150 --> 00:39:28,170
He's still alive.

713
00:39:30,040 --> 00:39:30,730
Sister.

714
00:39:32,250 --> 00:39:32,810
Did you

715
00:39:33,310 --> 00:39:34,480
receive

716
00:39:35,270 --> 00:39:36,200
a secret report?

717
00:39:36,270 --> 00:39:37,530
He asked me to save him.

718
00:39:39,760 --> 00:39:41,760
He asked me to send men to rescue him.

719
00:39:49,020 --> 00:39:50,210
He's still alive.

720
00:39:53,110 --> 00:39:54,750
He told me himself.

721
00:39:58,250 --> 00:39:58,960
Alive!

722
00:40:00,120 --> 00:40:00,890
Still alive!

723
00:40:04,730 --> 00:40:05,730
He's still alive.

724
00:40:11,220 --> 00:40:14,580
[Countdown: 8 Days]

725
00:41:13,080 --> 00:41:13,940
Your Highness.

726
00:41:14,890 --> 00:41:16,220
How's your arrow wound?

727
00:41:17,440 --> 00:41:18,040
It's fine.

728
00:41:19,310 --> 00:41:20,210
In a few days,

729
00:41:20,850 --> 00:41:22,980
the arrowhead will fall off by itself.

730
00:41:25,750 --> 00:41:28,100
I've studied the waterway maps carefully.

731
00:41:28,100 --> 00:41:30,160
On the eastern shore of Machang Lake,

732
00:41:30,170 --> 00:41:31,420
there's a branch of the prefectural lake

733
00:41:31,420 --> 00:41:33,890
that flows east into
the Daqing and Xiaoqing Rivers.

734
00:41:33,890 --> 00:41:36,100
We can still change boats
and make it in time.

735
00:41:36,100 --> 00:41:37,900
The Daqing and Xiaoqing Rivers?

736
00:41:39,080 --> 00:41:40,480
What are you planning to do there?

737
00:41:40,480 --> 00:41:42,690
We'll take the Xiaoqing River
to Luokou Town and disembark.

738
00:41:42,690 --> 00:41:44,220
Jinan City is right nearby.

739
00:41:44,890 --> 00:41:45,730
Jinan?

740
00:41:48,920 --> 00:41:50,980
Don't tell me you're planning to
rescue that Wu Dingyuan.

741
00:41:50,980 --> 00:41:51,780
That's right.

742
00:41:51,980 --> 00:41:53,580
Can you stop being reckless?

743
00:41:57,150 --> 00:41:58,480
I'm not being reckless.

744
00:41:58,690 --> 00:42:01,520
He's fallen into enemy hands,
and his life hangs in the balance.

745
00:42:01,520 --> 00:42:03,250
How can I just abandon him?

746
00:42:04,330 --> 00:42:05,190
Your Highness.

747
00:42:05,580 --> 00:42:06,710
Have you forgotten?

748
00:42:06,870 --> 00:42:07,810
You once swore

749
00:42:08,100 --> 00:42:09,700
you'd return to the capital.

750
00:42:10,580 --> 00:42:11,910
This is for the Emperor,

751
00:42:12,390 --> 00:42:14,250
for the imperial clan, for the state,

752
00:42:14,250 --> 00:42:15,910
and for your duty as its ruler.

753
00:42:21,730 --> 00:42:24,890
"The people come first, the state second,
and the ruler last."

754
00:42:24,890 --> 00:42:27,150
Didn't you say that yourself, Yu Tingyi?

755
00:42:27,390 --> 00:42:28,770
Is Wu Dingyuan not one of the people?

756
00:42:28,770 --> 00:42:30,310
Is Kong Shiba not one of the people?

757
00:42:30,310 --> 00:42:31,370
Must I turn my back

758
00:42:31,830 --> 00:42:33,400
on them time and time again?

759
00:42:38,790 --> 00:42:41,540
As the Right Rectifier of
the Right Secretariat of the Heir Apparent,

760
00:42:41,540 --> 00:42:44,710
my duty is to impeach and bring to light
the misdeeds of the Crown Prince.

761
00:42:44,710 --> 00:42:46,840
If the heir apparent acts improperly,

762
00:42:46,960 --> 00:42:48,090
I must admonish him.

763
00:42:48,270 --> 00:42:50,000
If gentle remonstrance fails,
I must speak more forcefully.

764
00:42:50,000 --> 00:42:51,260
And if that also fails,

765
00:42:51,960 --> 00:42:54,690
I must be prepared to give my life
to make my point.

766
00:43:01,810 --> 00:43:02,610
Rectifier Yu.

767
00:43:03,870 --> 00:43:05,000
The decision I made,

768
00:43:05,600 --> 00:43:06,680
you cannot stop.

